{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>現年22歲香港網球選手黃澤林與陳奕迅愛女陳康堤結束半年情後，隨即火速搭上25歲模特兒譚旻萱並傳出同居。男方不僅被指豪擲5萬月租別墅金屋藏嬌，女方舊愛更發布綠色手掌照片疑似控訴遭到背叛。這段牽涉多人的複雜多角關係背後隱藏着令人咋舌感情內幕。</p>\n<h2>黃澤林陪母購物狂撳手機被揭心不在焉</h2>\n<p>黃澤林被目擊陪同母親現身金鐘大型商場掃貨，期間他雖然主動幫忙提着大袋戰利品，但全程化身低頭族緊盯手機螢幕，手指不斷在鍵盤上飛舞傳送短訊。消息指他早已豪花每月5萬租下西貢一幢2,000呎獨立別墅作為與譚旻萱同居愛巢，兩人上月在澳門觀看籃球賽散場時更被發現登上同一輛七人車，在車廂後座情不自禁深情對望兼溫柔摸面。</p>\n<h2>知情人士大爆譚旻萱拜金綠茶上位情史</h2>\n<p>有知情人士透露黃澤林早於今年8月便與譚旻萱秘密撻着，休賽返港期間屢次以各種荒謬藉口推搪陳康堤約會邀請。另一方面譚旻萱過往情史亦被翻出，友人聲稱她表面直率實質為人好勝拜金，過往與新晉導演舊愛拍拖時便火速進駐對方大坑寓所，如今結識身價不菲新一代體育明星同樣重施故技。女方前任排球教練區顯揚更在社交平台連發三帖，上載染成綠色手掌照片暗示自己慘遭劈腿。</p>\n<h2>網民狠批男方行為不負責任兼心機算盡</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後迅速在各大討論區引發熱烈討論，大批網民對陳康堤遭遇深表同情，留言直斥「公開宣布單身第二日就同新歡去廣州南沙打波，擺明一早搭上」。不少人將矛頭指向女方，狠批「綠茶手段真係高明，次次拍拖都識得搵有錢人包養」。同時亦有網民對陳奕迅當初熱心做媒感到無奈，感嘆「老竇睇錯人搞到個女受傷，真係好心做壞事」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540228671361_6014454896ae8b44a6ef53.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540228671361_6014454896ae8b44a6ef53.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黃澤林坦承獨自在海外比賽時經常感到孤單，心理上十分需要有人在身邊給予鼓勵。（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540375952174_9172864476ae8b44be38c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540375952174_9172864476ae8b44be38c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>他特別提到譚旻萱在身邊扮演著重要角色，直言：「我需要佢嘅時候，佢都會喺度」。（圖片來源：譚旻萱IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179317519224680369_7705340376ae1ae988ac3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 （圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179317519224680369_7705340376ae1ae988ac3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936247789957190_3367216036ae88acb2d981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 香港網球一哥黃澤林近日飛往首爾出戰ATP挑戰賽，身邊竟然出現人氣女星譚旻萱甜蜜同行。（圖片來源：IG@hambittttt）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936247789957190_3367216036ae88acb2d981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>香港網球一哥黃澤林近日飛往首爾出戰ATP挑戰賽，身邊竟然出現人氣女星譚旻萱甜蜜同行。（圖片來源：IG@hambittttt）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mandytam_20__16720809296999c3026a59d-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚旻萱 黃澤林 （圖片來源：《夜王》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mandytam_20__16720809296999c3026a59d-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《夜王》）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:23.310120+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1087,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:08.073472+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:12.935263+00:00","content_hash":"d3b59e2980cd1bf6db8c28d68958beb6158af615ea616dbea1f4afb3e388e47e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}